<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  A plain file, written by hand and served straight off disk.

  The real sitemap is built from the database at /sitemap.xml and carries
  every dish. This one exists so that a crawler which cannot fetch that one
  still finds the pages that matter, and so a failure in Search Console tells
  us which half is at fault: if this file fetches and the other does not, the
  route is at fault; if neither does, nothing of ours is being reached at all.
-->
